        },
        {
          "text": "“Akainaki ayoŋ Papa kaŋ ŋiboro daadaŋ. Emam ituŋanan eyeni atemar Lokoku iŋes ŋae, mati Papa, nabo emam ŋini eyeni atemar Papa iŋes ŋae, mati Lokoku ka ŋulu daadaŋ ecamit Lokoku akitoodikin Papa keŋ neni kec.",
          "type": "text",
